{"id":1041104,"chapter_id":1041104,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"【新城医院，刺杀事件后】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你再次走入这间病房。床头的花生机勃勃，床上的人却始终只是淡淡看着窗口。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"新鲜的苹果汁水饱满，这段时间你削苹果的手艺提升了不少。正准备招呼克莱门汀来吃，风吹过，放在窗台的手写稿被吹得哗啦啦飞起来。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"你赶忙放下小刀，去接满天的稿纸。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"不是什么重要的东西，我应该不会再继续写下去了。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"局长","content":"但我很在意这个故事。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"那给你留着，当个念想也不错。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"我体弱多病手无缚鸡之力，还弄丢了到手的工作，之后大概也是个无业游民。嗯，只能靠你养活了。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"她把你削的苹果雕成小兔子形状，自己吃了一个，留了一个在盘子里给你。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"如何？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"局长","content":"……不愧是堪称狂级的实力，我们管理局一向专人专岗，也不是不能有一位专门削小兔子苹果的同事。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"在你没话找话聊了半个钟头后，克莱门汀温和地看着你，示意你今日访客时间结束，她需要休息静养了。你只得跟她道别。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"离开病房，你又仔细看了一遍她的病情报告。克莱门汀的身体并无大碍，只是这种精神状态实在令人担忧。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"【回忆】","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，这是近期对禁闭者克莱门汀的监察情况汇总。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"夜莺发来的汇报足足有三页，里面记录的情况非常详细，总结下来包括以下几点：行为高度固化、社交回避倾向明显、兴趣与注意力衰退，以及生理指标与行为矛盾。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"除了这些类似“躯体化”的表现外，在心理和情绪监测软件上面的数据也并不乐观，也许有必要进行一些干预和疏导？","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"局长","content":"她本人怎么说？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"只是说……“需要时间调整”。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"这说辞怎么跟在录音里听到的一模一样？统一的外交辞令？","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"小文","content":"不仅如此，克莱门汀小姐还经常忘记自己要干什么。上次我想去找她讨论新书，她正拿着下午茶的托盘，去露台找位置，被我叫住才发现托盘里居然什么都没有！","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"局长","content":"没记错的话，那次她低血糖晕倒了，喊了医生打葡萄糖才好转一点。","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"小文","content":"对！就是那次，局长，她是不是有什么心事啊？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"局长","content":"……","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"【回忆结束】","style":18,"background":1018,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"出院当日，你再次邀请克莱门汀陪你前往某个地方。","style":3,"background":1018,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"又有新的任务？还是，新的诱饵？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1018,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"options":["这次是团建"],"style":6,"background":1018,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104028,"trial_step":28,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这次是团建","goto":29}]},{"step":29,"speaker":"局长","content":"只是邀请你一起走走，我们这的职场还是比较注重劳逸结合的。","style":2,"background":1018,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"话说着，你们停在一座宏伟的门前。这是某所学校的大门，学校正在举办校园开放日，门口家长学生和社会各界人士络绎不绝。","style":3,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"你们经过一番乔装打扮，看上去与新城体面的中产家庭无异。","style":3,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"这里是……学校？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"局长","content":"是啊。你上学的时候参加过社团活动吗？","style":2,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"短暂参与过一些吧。舞台剧、剧本杀、推理社，还有标本制作小组。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"options":["还挺丰富","那刚好带你体验点别的"],"style":6,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"还挺丰富","goto":36},{"text":"那刚好带你体验点别的","goto":null}]},{"step":36,"speaker":"局长","content":"走，跟我来。","style":2,"background":1011,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"你们刚好踩着铃声进入教室，这里正在举办一场公开辩论赛。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"反方辩手","content":"——迟到的正义更像一场生者的自我安慰。它安抚生者，却永远无法抵达逝者。当正义错过生命的有效期，它便失去了温度和意义——","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"克莱门汀挑眉。她抬头看向辩题——","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"<size=45><color=#7683a2><b><i>“迟到的正义是否仍为正义”</size>","style":14,"background":1032,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"这……是你安排的？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"局长","content":"不，只是巧合。我要是真想用这种办法灌鸡汤，肯定会选个更巧妙点的方式。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"台上，正反方辩手还在互相博弈。到底不过是那些陈词滥调，显然克莱门汀也并没兴致细听。克莱门汀还想说什么，但你把食指抵在唇前，示意她小声看台上。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"局长","content":"嘘，正方的最后一位辩手要发言了。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"讲台上，一名叫莉迪亚的辩手格外吸引人的目光。她清脆的声音贯穿全场，清晰地传到你们耳边。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"那按照对方逻辑，调查悬案的治安官是否该停止工作？因为真相对社会已无意义？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"反方辩手","content":"调查悬案的目的是“履行责任”，其核心价值在于向社会传递“罪行不会被遗忘”的信号，这是一种警示与预防，而非正义。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"正义的本质正是通过这种系统性的“责任履行”得以显现。如果按照对方逻辑，法院对已故罪犯的缺席审判也毫无意义。我们为何坚持这样做，正因为这标志着正义作为绝对价值，其效力超越生死。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"反方辩手","content":"但那只是生者的慰藉！当正义沦为对生者的心理补偿，便降低了它应有的神圣门槛——","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"莉迪亚眨了眨眼，接收到己方辩友递来的眼神。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"很巧妙的诱导。你侧目看向克莱门汀，她的眼睛也同时微微睁大。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"反方辩友将正义简化为“对个体的即时补偿”，但我方认为，正义的意义其实在于全社会共同的记忆与契约。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"也正是对它的不懈追讨，才让人类避免了在错误中永恒沉睡。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"——在迟到的正义中，我们对抗时间与遗忘，不断争取，因此在下一次，它才有可能在悲剧发生前抵达。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"很快铃声响起，少女的总结陈词足够精彩。现场观众的掌声久久不息。不少人喊着莉迪亚的名字为她吹口哨，鼓掌欢呼。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"讲台上的莉迪亚长舒一口气，跑过去跟对手们一一握手，接着向着人群俏皮地弯腰行礼，揉了揉自己激动地有些泛红的脸颊。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"…………","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"人们讨论着刚才的辩题和接下来想去的活动，缓慢有序地离开教室。克莱门汀还怔怔看着台上。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"你顺着克莱门汀的视线看过去，坐在讲台上晃动双腿的莉迪亚已经完全松懈下来，像这个年纪该有的样子，正笑得阳光灿烂，目送着观众离开。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"她高举着胳膊，露出手臂上的大片烧伤——你知道克莱门汀也认出了那个女孩。<color=#fb9259>那是她当年救下的孩子。</color>","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"……这才是你的安排，对不对。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"options":["哎呀，是不是呢？","要不你猜猜看？"],"style":6,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104062,"trial_step":62,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"哎呀，是不是呢？","goto":63},{"text":"要不你猜猜看？","goto":null}]},{"step":63,"speaker":"局长","content":"猜对了我就告诉你。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"曾经克莱门汀用来糊弄你的话被你用来反怼回去，克莱门汀失笑摇头。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"——你们好，冒昧打扰，二位是谁的亲属吗？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"耳边突然传来少女清亮的声音。莉迪亚不知何时来到你们身侧，敏锐的目光在你和克莱门汀之间打转。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"只是在讨论刚才的辩题。很久没回校园了，稍微有些兴奋……抱歉，打扰到你了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"克莱门汀的笑容礼貌又得体，但你看到她的手微不可察地紧紧交叠着，像是在忍耐。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"哇，原来是这样啊！刚才在台上我就注意到你们啦。我说你们看着不像学生，也不像家长呢，难道是单纯对辩题有兴趣才来我们学校吗？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"我……","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"局长","content":"其实我们是来帮家里的妹妹看看学校的。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"你接过克莱门汀的话头，拿出那套早就准备好的说辞。言辞恳切，语气真诚。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"局长","content":"她也拿到了新城大学的录取通知。不过她还是感觉比较迷茫，想听听这所学校的学生是怎么坚定自己的专业和未来目标的。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"局长","content":"同学你呢？你是怎么想着报考这所学校？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"content":"莉迪亚认真思考了一下，然后挠了挠头。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"说起来还有些不好意思……其实，我小时候在孤儿院生活过一段时间。那里有一个姐姐，她的梦想就是来这所学校。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"你偷瞄克莱门汀的表情，她格外认真地注视着莉迪亚，眼中涌动着某种复杂的情绪。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"那她……她最后来这所学校念书了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"莉迪亚笑着重重点头。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"当然啊，她超级厉害的！但我那会儿太小了，领养前的事情记不太清楚……哦，不过，听说她好像很早就拿到了通知书，还发了小说呢。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"小时候她就总给我们读书，我们都喜欢听她的故事，就好像那里白天还是孤儿院，到了夜里就会变成一个奇幻的冒险世界。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"嘿嘿……虽然没在学校见过她，但遥远地和她成为校友，我很开心。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"少女的笑容极具感染力，让人看得也不禁嘴角上扬。她脸侧也有一片烧伤，但她并不遮掩，反而把它大方亮出来，宛若某种奖章。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"局长","content":"这么说来，你在她的影响下来到这所学校？你也想和她一样，成为一个小说家？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"不！我要当大检察官！","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"……我所在的孤儿院发生过一些事，那时我太小了，还不了解那意味着什么。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"但后来，我知道那个案件的真相被揭露，坏人得到了应有的惩罚！所以我转读了法学，希望毕业以后能进入司法系统，亲自维护正义。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"……但这只是个例。更多的真相没能沉冤昭雪，坏人也没有得到处罚。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"如果……有规则之外的手段，一种更有效的手段去消灭这一切呢？你还会选择这条路吗？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"熟悉的语调，你听出她认真了起来，不像刚才跟你有一搭没一搭的样子。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"不要紧的。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"莉迪亚毫不犹豫，给出了极为坚定的答案。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"虽然还在校园里，可我知道，我们的法律还很脆弱，有无数愤怒和憎恶的力量会轻而易举破坏掉它。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"就像刚才有人质疑的那样……如果法律没办法立刻回应人们的愿望，制裁坏人，保护好人，那守护它是否就毫无意义呢？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"我的答案永远是不。我愿意相信迟到的正义终将到来。法律凝聚着人们对正义的向往，并不只是法律在守护人，更是人们在守护它。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"正因如此，无论发生过什么，我都愿意成为这样的人。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"莉迪亚把手放在胸前。这次你看到了，她坦荡亮出的，正是胳膊上当年劫后余生留下的伤疤。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"content":"你没来由地想起那颗乳牙，它的主人曾经说自己的梦想是长大。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"content":"那个时候，这对她来说意味着什么呢？无关大火与伤疤，那是月光下明亮的小窗，是姐姐书里永远讲不完的冒险故事，是庭院里茁壮高大的树木，总在炎夏投下阴凉。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"拨开一层薄薄的泥土和几片叶子，或大或小的梦想们就被认认真真地藏在树下。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"没有人教过她如何才能长大，但她看着姐姐的样子偷偷学会了。也许克莱门汀走过的那条路，她也曾走过。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"content":"穿过孤独和黑暗的潮水，时至今日，她终于站在了你们面前。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"克莱门汀始终淡淡地笑着，听她认真地讲。莉迪亚突然有些不好意思摸摸手臂。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"啊呀！抱歉，我又代入刚才辩论的状态了，哈哈哈。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"我知道我还是个初出茅庐的小丫头，对社会的黑暗完全不了解，说这些简直就像是在吹牛似的。同学们也都说我太天真也太较真了……","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"但我认为，不管是法律还是社会的进步，都要靠天真且勇敢的人去推动，那么，我愿意做其中之一！","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"我想，不管是姐姐还是孤儿院的其他家人……都会支持我的决定，并为我感到骄傲吧！","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"少女稚嫩的脸庞上镶嵌着亮如宝石的眼睛，照得克莱门汀一阵怔愣。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"是啊，她们一定会为你而骄傲的。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"content":"讲台上，有人在叫莉迪亚。时间不多了，她该走了，但仍有空余再问一个问题。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"content":"克莱门汀抬头，试图透过镜片、透过时光看清少女的脸。或许是阳光太好，她的手都不像以前那么冰冷，连带着心头涌起一阵暖意。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"那么，最后一个问题……","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"莉迪亚，你现在过得好吗，幸福吗？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"content":"莉迪亚皱着眉认真思考了一会儿。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"哎，肯定还是有很多小事不顺利嘛，但现在有很多爱我支持我的人，和很多我爱的人，所以我敢确信，我一定很幸福。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"content":"铃声响起，莉迪亚向你们挥挥手。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"我也该走啦，还有下一场活动——和你们聊天很开心，也祝你们两位幸福哦！","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"莉迪亚跑出去了一段，又突然想起什么，急急忙忙折回来，从包上解下一个松果和种子做成的风铃挂坠。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"这个送你！不知怎么养成的习惯，我每次看到树下的种子都想好好把它们收藏起来，久而久之就有了这么一串风铃。很可爱吧？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_119"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"也许是我的错觉，姐姐你听到叮铃哐啷七嘴八舌乱七八糟的动静的时候，总会露出很安心的表情。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":100000120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"莉迪亚","content":"而且，姐姐你很像一个人！不知道为什么我就是想多看看你，多跟你说说话……总之你一定要收下！就这样，我走了！","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_121"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"克莱门汀没机会拒绝，女孩已经跑远了。手中被塞了串挂坠，她呆在原地，过了一会儿才缓缓拿起种子风铃端详着。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"橡子、榛子、染银松子，还有铁莲子……哦，这儿还有苍耳和山毛榉坚果。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"content":"这些词从你耳朵里圆润地进去又出来。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"options":["你懂得还挺多"],"style":6,"background":1032,"is_centered":true,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104125,"trial_step":125,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你懂得还挺多","goto":126}]},{"step":126,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"写书时可是要用到很多稀奇古怪的知识。比方说在这些风干的松子壳里放一些真菌孢子，挂在窗口，孢子散播，过量吸入致幻，而风铃的声音会加剧这种幻觉……","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"speaker":"局长","content":"这种小众的知识就不必告诉我了！","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"content":"你下意识离她手上的风铃远了些。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"content":"克莱门汀看着你的样子，终于畅快地笑了起来，手上的风铃叮铃哐啷作响。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"options":["心情好些了？"],"style":6,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104130,"trial_step":130,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"心情好些了？","goto":131}]},{"step":131,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"是啊，多亏了你。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"content":"克莱门汀看向莉迪亚离去的方向。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"莉迪亚……都过去那么久了，你是怎么找到她的？","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"speaker":"局长","content":"调查的时候，我们修复了红杉木当年的领养系统，大火前的数据还有残缺，但那之后幸存孩子的资料是齐全的。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"局长","content":"收养她的家庭很爱护她，一直记录着她的成长，虽然名字变了，但花点时间总是能找到的。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"她胳膊上的痕迹是爆炸时伤的。这么多年了，那个位置我看一眼就能想起来。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"speaker":"局长","content":"人还没走远，要不要赶过去跟她相认？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"不了。这情节太俗套，我的职业底线可不允许。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"局长","content":"说什么呢？某人不是还费尽心思给我透题来着吗？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"content":"你摸出口袋里那张用来写着安全屋地址的小卡。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"options":["你早算准了"],"style":6,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104141,"trial_step":141,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你早算准了","goto":142}]},{"step":142,"speaker":"局长","content":"以大作家克莱门汀的水平，你绝对可以把自己的联络方式藏得更好。你是算准了我会发现你的线索，会一路找到你的安全屋。","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"speaker":"局长","content":"……但说真的，有必要这么麻烦吗？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104143,"trial_step":143},{"step":144,"content":"克莱门汀笑而不语装傻，她的目光投向女孩离开的方向，像是目送种子乘风而去的树。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104144,"trial_step":144},{"step":145,"speaker":"局长","content":"总之，现在能放心了？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104145,"trial_step":145},{"step":146,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"……只要知道她幸福就好。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104146,"trial_step":146},{"step":147,"content":"暮色沉降，校园里的路灯依次亮起。学生们三三两两走在你们身旁，有人呼朋引伴，有人转身没入图书馆的楼群里，长椅上有人耳语。","style":3,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104147,"trial_step":147},{"step":148,"content":"而你们也准备离开，回到自己的归处。","style":3,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104148,"trial_step":148},{"step":149,"content":"<i><b>这就是故事的结局了。</i>","style":14,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104149,"trial_step":149},{"step":150,"content":"<i><b>孩子们最终从伤痛中痊愈，擦干泪水继续上路。\n\n而被困在原地多年的故人，她的时间也终于开始流动。</i>","style":14,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104150,"trial_step":150},{"step":151,"content":"春天的风已经有一丝暖意，将克莱门汀的衣摆扬起。她看向走在自己面前的那个灰色影子。","style":3,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104151,"trial_step":151},{"step":152,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"<i>${PlayerName}，其实我最后没能来这里念书。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_151"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104152,"trial_step":152},{"step":153,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"<i>曾经那个爱幻想的我……我一直以为她已经死在那场大火里，所有的美好与希望也跟她一起消失了。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104153,"trial_step":153},{"step":154,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"<i>但……也给了我一些新的盼头。","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104154,"trial_step":154},{"step":155,"content":"<i><b>正义是公平与惩戒，但它的最终目的是爱、仁慈、节制与希望。</i>","style":14,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104155,"trial_step":155},{"step":156,"content":"<i><b>假以时日，当大火燃尽，这片灼烧的废土上也会冒出新芽。\n\n那些生命永远不会真正逝去，因为总有人带着爱、带着思念、带着他们托付的一切走向未来。</i>","style":14,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104156,"trial_step":156},{"step":157,"content":"<i><b>过去种种不可追，但仍有光明在前，值得追随。</i>","style":14,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104157,"trial_step":157},{"step":158,"content":"克莱门汀踏着轻快的步伐越过你，无论行走在哪条路上她都是这样迈步向前。","style":3,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104158,"trial_step":158},{"step":159,"content":"所幸，这里的景色她很喜欢。","style":3,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104159,"trial_step":159},{"step":160,"content":"那颗曾经塞满仇恨、在手刃仇人后变得空虚的心，正一点点被填入新的情感，风铃一样发出悦耳的声音。","style":3,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104160,"trial_step":160},{"step":161,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"<i>如果某天，红杉木的种子能散播出去，飘摇四海，落在别处生根发芽。有朝一日，目之所及万木成林，侧耳倾听，风铃悦耳……</i>","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104161,"trial_step":161},{"step":162,"speaker":"克莱门汀","content":"<i>……我期待着这样的未来。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_41101_4_157"],"voice_bank":"vo_kelaimenting_trial","style":1,"background":1044,"log_type":1,"src_id":141104162,"trial_step":162}]}